        <p>Save doctors' fees ; cure yourself at a moderate cost. Munyon's Home Doctor Book will tell you how to treat yourself at home with shilling remedies to be obtained from any chemist. A. copy of this book can be obtained free (if the " Warrington Examiner is mentioned) by any- one writing to the Munyon Company, 61, New Oxford-street; London, W.O</p>
